      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MR. OBERON (8) had the drop on the lead early on but could only manage second, beaten 2.5 lengths (22.90) at this track in a Grade 5 over 400m. Overdue and gets his chance. WATCH AND SEE (5) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (19.62) last time out at Angle Park. Form at this distance is sound. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Can feature again. HELLO SWEETHEART (1) has a strong record this trip with seven wins and two placings from 17 starts. Scored by a neck last time (23.15) in a Other over 400m at Mt Gambier. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. AMRON TIGER (2) drops in distance and is not to be underestimated.",
